  "stage": "Phase 3",
  "catalyst_date": "2026-03-10",
  "catalyst_source": "https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/edgewise-announces-positive-long-term-sevasemten-data-demonstrating-sustained-functional-stabilization-in-becker-muscular-dystrophy-through-3-5-years-of-follow-up-302708743.html",
  "catalyst_text": "Presented positive long term Becker data at conference",
  "detailed_catalyst_text": "Long-term clinical data from the MESA open-label extension in Becker muscular dystrophy were presented at a scientific conference, showing stabilization of NSAA functional scores over up to 3.5 years. Findings contrasted with predicted natural history declines and safety remained favorable with over 3 years of exposure. These results reinforce prior signals and support the ongoing pivotal program in this indication.",
  "catalyst_text_evidence": "BOULDER, Colo., 2026-03-10 /PRNewswire/ -- Edgewise Therapeutics, Inc. ... today presented at the 2026 MDA Clinical and Scientific Conference, long-term data from its MESA open-label extension study of sevasemten in Becker muscular dystrophy (Becker).... The data show participants on sevasemten experienced stabilization of function over 3.5 years in marked contrast to the functional decline expected from Becker natural history data. Sevasemten ... continued to show a favorable safety profile in MESA with long-term exposure for 3+ years.",
  "news_published_at": "2026-03-11T00:00:00Z",
  "open_price_gap_percent": "0.00000",
